// An array as a value, one past the end, n-ary, long arithmetic: `x = a - c - 1`. KIELER runs it: x is 0, -3, -3.
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y initial state A do x = a - c - 1 go to A }
